"The server address could not be found. Check the host name and that the TV is on the same network." = "Naslova strežnika ni bilo mogoče najti. Preverite ime gostitelja in ali je televizor v istem omrežju.";
"The server could not be reached. Check its address, Wi-Fi or VPN, then retry. Your saved login is retained." = "Strežnik ni dosegljiv. Preverite njegov naslov, Wi-Fi ali VPN in poskusite znova. Shranjena prijava se ohrani.";
"The server could not be reached. Check that it is running and that the TV is on the network, then try again." = "Strežnik ni dosegljiv. Preverite, ali deluje in ali je televizor povezan z omrežjem, ter poskusite znova.";
